ted_text to the entire reading, and reason to JSON null (not a string). Do not add a completion comment such as \"No further action required.\" For an incomplete or uncertain reading, set coverage to \"incomplete\", corrected_text to JSON null, and reason to a nonempty explanation. Never provide a complete reading while reporting uncertainty.\n\nSource-boundary rule: If the assigned text ends in a word cut off by the registered crop, return coverage \"incomplete\", corrected_text null, and a concrete reason. Do not infer or append unseen letters from language probability. Preserve supported historical wording and fully visible line continuations; do not silently extend the assigned target beyond the image.\n\nWhen a word is divided across two printed lines solely because the line ends, join its visible parts into one word in the corrected reading. Preserve genuine compound-word hyphens and punctuation dashes. Use the image and the full assigned target to distinguish these cases; do not invent missing letters or continue beyond the assigned target.","role":"system"},{"content":"{\"context_regions\":[],\"contract\":\"ocr-productive-repair-input-v3\",\"diagnostics\":{\"configuration_sha256\":\"c40522ad5c31117695636471e2710474f615a1863c7f1c1e2b7f2f8603e16313\",\"detector_sha256\":\"0f06e3a8bd1c8b7a14175b5610f3127e05934e138831252d300eb86dbf9a4509\",\"negative_targets\":[],\"signals\":[{\"category\":\"word\",\"flags\":[\"post_repair_word_unfamiliar\"],\"paragraph_alias\":\"P1\",\"raw_end\":25,\"raw_quote\":\"dethrones\",\"raw_start\":16,\"route_reason\":\"Inspect the entire target against the image; this is not a verified error.\",\"signal_id\":\"f3d637e7f8bb04af22cd12061e0f25296c30b1c6bc02aa1ece420668a6beae26\"},{\"category\":\"word\",\"flags\":[\"post_repair_word_unfamiliar\"],\"paragraph_alias\":\"P1\",\"raw_end\":53,\"raw_quote\":\"sumes\",\"raw_start\":48,\"route_reason\":\"Inspect the entire target against the image; this is not a verified error.\",\"signal_id\":\"2